  "design": {
    "idea": "ASTONISHING: Pull the Master Capsize Wheel to roll the ship chamber 90 degrees onto its beam-ends, flooding the hull abyss into a Skiff canal, waking Brine Lampreys, and Ballast-Clamping a drifting mirror-raft in front of the porthole eye.",
    "kind": "puzzle",
    "beat": "ten",
    "teaches": "Capsize transforms architecture into navigable water; Ballast Clamp holds drifting Tide Rafts steady for tight blue-bank shots.",
    "decisions": 10,
    "expert_s": 62,
    "reward": "chartroom_access",
    "why": "Signature astonishing centerpiece of The Drowned Galleon synthesizing capsize, Skiff canal, lampreys, and Ballast Clamp.",
